   var border=new FrameworkElementFactory(typeof(Border),"SelectionBorder");border.SetValue(Border.BackgroundProperty,new TemplateBindingExtension(Control.BackgroundProperty));border.SetValue(Border.BorderBrushProperty,new TemplateBindingExtension(Control.BorderBrushProperty));border.SetValue(Border.BorderThicknessProperty,new Thickness(1));border.SetValue(Border.CornerRadiusProperty,new CornerRadius(5));border.SetValue(Border.PaddingProperty,new TemplateBindingExtension(Control.PaddingProperty));var header=new FrameworkElementFactory(typeof(ContentPresenter));header.SetValue(ContentPresenter.ContentSourceProperty,"Header");header.SetValue(FrameworkElement.HorizontalAlignmentProperty,new TemplateBindingExtension(Control.HorizontalContentAlignmentProperty));header.SetValue(FrameworkElement.VerticalAlignmentProperty,VerticalAlignment.Center);border.AppendChild(header);headerRow.AppendChild(border);root.AppendChild(headerRow);
   var children=new FrameworkElementFactory(typeof(ItemsPresenter),"ItemsPresenter");children.SetValue(FrameworkElement.MarginProperty,new Thickness(18,0,0,0));root.AppendChild(children);template.VisualTree=root;
   var noChildren=new Trigger{Property=TreeViewItem.HasItemsProperty,Value=false};noChildren.Setters.Add(new Setter(UIElement.VisibilityProperty,Visibility.Collapsed,"Expander"));template.Triggers.Add(noChildren);var collapsed=new Trigger{Property=TreeViewItem.IsExpandedProperty,Value=false};collapsed.Setters.Add(new Setter(UIElement.VisibilityProperty,Visibility.Collapsed,"ItemsPresenter"));template.Triggers.Add(collapsed);var hover=new Trigger{Property=UIElement.IsMouseOverProperty,Value=true};hover.Setters.Add(new Setter(Border.BackgroundProperty,raised,"SelectionBorder"));template.Triggers.Add(hover);var isSelected=new Trigger{Property=TreeViewItem.IsSelectedProperty,Value=true};isSelected.Setters.Add(new Setter(Border.BackgroundProperty,selected,"SelectionBorder"));isSelected.Setters.Add(new Setter(Border.BorderBrushProperty,accent,"SelectionBorder"));template.Triggers.Add(isSelected);style.Setters.Add(new Setter(Control.TemplateProperty,template));return style;
  }
  void ShowContextPopup(TreeViewItem item,StorageNode node){if(node==null)return;if(contextPopup!=null)contextPopup.IsOpen=false;var panel=new StackPanel();panel.Children.Add(PopupAction("Show in File Explorer",delegate{try{ShowInExplorer(node);}catch(Exception e){status.Text="Could not open File Explorer: "+e.Message;}}));panel.Children.Add(PopupAction("Copy full path",delegate{try{Clipboard.SetText(node.Path);status.Text="Path copied: "+node.Path;}catch(Exception e){status.Text="Could not copy path: "+e.Message;}}));panel.Children.Add(new Border{Height=1,Background=new SolidColorBrush(Color.FromRgb(43,35,29)),Margin=new Thickness(8,3,8,3)});panel.Children.Add(PopupAction("Delete (send to Recycle Bin)",delegate{DeleteNode(item,node);},!IsScanRoot(node)));var frame=new Border{Background=new SolidColorBrush(Color.FromRgb(26,22,19)),BorderBrush=new SolidColorBrush(Color.FromRgb(43,35,29)),BorderThickness=new Thickness(1),CornerRadius=new CornerRadius(6),Padding=new Thickness(4),Child=panel};contextPopup=new Popup{Child=frame,PlacementTarget=item,Placement=PlacementMode.MousePoint,StaysOpen=true,AllowsTransparency=true};contextPopup.IsOpen=true;}
  void DismissContextPopup(object sender,MouseButtonEventArgs e){if(contextPopup!=null&&contextPopup.IsOpen)contextPopup.IsOpen=false;}
  Button PopupAction(string label,Action action,bool enabled=true){var button=new Button{Content=label,HorizontalContentAlignment=HorizontalAlignment.Left,Padding=new Thickness(9,7,16,7),Foreground=new SolidColorBrush(Color.FromRgb(243,236,228)),Background=Brushes.Transparent,BorderThickness=new Thickness(0),IsEnabled=enabled,Cursor=System.Windows.Input.Cursors.Hand,FocusVisualStyle=null};var template=new ControlTemplate(typeof(Button));var border=new FrameworkElementFactory(typeof(Border),"HoverBackground");border.SetValue(Border.BackgroundProperty,new TemplateBindingExtension(Control.BackgroundProperty));border.SetValue(Border.CornerRadiusProperty,new CornerRadius(3));border.SetValue(Border.PaddingProperty,new TemplateBindingExtension(Control.PaddingProperty));var content=new FrameworkElementFactory(typeof(ContentPresenter));content.SetValue(ContentPresenter.HorizontalAlignmentProperty,HorizontalAlignment.Left);content.SetValue(ContentPresenter.VerticalAlignmentProperty,VerticalAlignment.Center);border.AppendChild(content);template.VisualTree=border;var hover=new Trigger{Property=UIElement.IsMouseOverProperty,Value=true};hover.Setters.Add(new Setter(Border.BackgroundProperty,new SolidColorBrush(Color.FromRgb(54,39,25)),"HoverBackground"));hover.Setters.Add(new Setter(Control.ForegroundProperty,new SolidColorBrush(Color.FromRgb(242,165,90))));template.Triggers.Add(hover);var disabled=new Trigger{Property=UIElement.IsEnabledProperty,Value=false};disabled.Setters.Add(new Setter(Control.ForegroundProperty,new SolidColorBrush(Color.FromRgb(111,99,88))));template.Triggers.Add(disabled);button.Template=template;button.Click+=delegate{if(contextPopup!=null)contextPopup.IsOpen=false;try{action();}catch(Exception e){status.Text=e.Message;}};return button;}
  bool IsScanRoot(StorageNode node){return !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(scannedRoot)&&string.Equals(Path.GetFullPath(node.Path).TrimEnd(Path.DirectorySeparatorChar,Path.AltDirectorySeparatorChar),scannedRoot.TrimEnd(Path.DirectorySeparatorChar,Path.AltDirectorySeparatorChar),StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase);}
  void ShowInExplorer(StorageNode node){if(node==null||string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(node.Path))throw new InvalidOperationException("Select a file or folder first.");string explorer=Path.Combine(Environment.GetFolderPath(Environment.SpecialFolder.Windows),"explorer.exe");string args=node.Directory?"\""+node.Path+"\"":"/select,\""+node.Path+"\"";Process.Start(new ProcessStartInfo(explorer,args){UseShellExecute=true});}
  void DeleteNode(TreeViewItem item,StorageNode node){
   try{
    if(IsScanRoot(node))throw new InvalidOperationException("The scan root cannot be deleted from Disk Explorer.");
    string full=Path.GetFullPath(node.Path),root=Path.GetFullPath(scannedRoot).TrimEnd(Path.DirectorySeparatorChar,Path.AltDirectorySeparatorChar)+Path.DirectorySeparatorChar;
    if(!full.StartsWith(root,StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))throw new InvalidOperationException("This item is outside the scanned folder.");
    if(!(File.Exists(full)||Directory.Exists(full)))throw new FileNotFoundException("This item no longer exists.",full);
    string kind=node.Directory?"folder and its contents":"file";var answer=MessageBox.Show(Window.GetWindow(this),"Send this "+kind+" to the Recycle Bin?\n\n"+full,"Delete item",MessageBoxButton.YesNo,MessageBoxImage.Warning,MessageBoxResult.No);
    if(answer!=MessageBoxResult.Yes)return;
    var operation=new SHFILEOPSTRUCT{wFunc=3,pFrom=full+"\0\0",fFlags=(ushort)(FOF_ALLOWUNDO|FOF_NOCONFIRMATION)};int result=SHFileOperation(ref operation);
    if(result!=0||operation.fAnyOperationsAborted)throw new IOException("Windows could not move this item to the Recycle Bin (error "+result+").");
    var parent=item.Parent as ItemsControl;if(parent!=null)parent.Items.Remove(item);status.Text="Sent to Recycle Bin: "+full;
   }catch(Exception e){status.Text="Delete failed: "+e.GetBaseException().Message;}
  }
  async Task Load(TreeViewItem item,StorageNode parent,int offset){
   try{
    var children=await service.ChildrenAsync(parent.Id,offset,cancellation.Token);
    foreach(var entry in children.rows??new ScanEntry[0]){
     // Treat scanner names as data; never turn an escaped path into an Explorer target.
     if(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(entry.name)||entry.name=="."||entry.name==".."||entry.name.IndexOfAny(new[]{'\\','/',':','"'})>=0)continue;
     string path=Path.GetFullPath(Path.Combine(parent.Path,entry.name));string prefix=scannedRoot.TrimEnd('\\')+"\\";if(!path.StartsWith(prefix,StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))continue;
     item.Items.Add(Node(entry.name+"   ·   "+(entry.size_bytes/1000000000d).ToString("0.###")+" GB",new StorageNode{Id=entry.id,Path=path,Directory=entry.is_directory}));
    }
    if(children.has_more){var more=new TreeViewItem{Header="Load next 500 entries…",Foreground=Brushes.Orange};more.Selected+=async delegate(object s,RoutedEventArgs e){e.Handled=true;item.Items.Remove(more);await Load(item,parent,offset+500);};item.Items.Add(more);}
   }catch(Exception e){if(!disposed)status.Text="Folder data unavailable: "+e.GetBaseException().Message;}
  }
  public async Task StopAsync(){if(cancellation!=null)cancellation.Cancel();if(service!=null){await service.CancelAsync();await service.StopAsync();}}
  public void Dispose(){disposed=true;if(ownerWindow!=null)ownerWindow.PreviewMouseDown-=DismissContextPopup;if(contextPopup!=null)contextPopup.IsOpen=false;if(cancellation!=null)cancellation.Cancel();if(service!=null)service.Dispose();}
 }
